      "title": "A Not-So-Scientific World",
      "gist": "Despite the scientific age, many people still believe in mysticism, ESP and failed expert methods in schooling and crime, and a quick test shows where nobody really knows anything.",
      "question": "Pseudoscience — why do so many people still believe things that don't work? (personal investigations)"
    },
