      "title": "What Cargo Cult Science Lacks",
      "gist": "Cargo cult science copies the forms of investigation but lacks scientific integrity: reporting everything that could cast doubt on your own work, unlike mere advertising honesty.",
      "question": "Cargo Cult Science — what essential thing is missing from work that looks scientific? (a definition by contrast)"
    },
