      "title": "Not Fooling Yourself",
      "gist": "The first principle is not fooling yourself, as the history of electron charge measurements shows, and it is learned by osmosis rather than taught.",
      "question": "Self-deception — why is the easiest person to fool yourself? (a historical example)"
    },
