      "title": "Honesty Toward the Public",
      "gist": "Scientists should not fool laymen or the government either, which means explaining real applications honestly and publishing results whichever way they come out.",
      "question": "Public honesty — why must scientists not shade results or claims to outsiders? (several examples)"
    },
